<p>Fires a barrage of charged missiles from your tail-mounted steamgun at a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> area, dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">149%, 169%, 185%, 198%, 210%</acronym> steamgun damage as lightning as well as dazing those within for 2 turns.</p><p>The daze chance increases with your Accuracy.</p>